  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "We now as users have the ability to self moderate, now that we can I'd like to request if the ratelimits for chatbubbles be drastically lowered, a lot of us who are using chatbubbles to develop software that isn't being used maliciously have a hard time supporting them without severely nerfing our software because of ever increasing limits. It would be nice to be able to update bubbles faster, and now that personal muting is a thing the limits are not in need of being as severely limited as they were prior.\n\n* 30/S cooldown for hitting the limits is extremely harsh.\n\n* Current ratelimit for bubbles in general is extremely harsh and should be knocked down to 1s.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/stop-nerfing-chatbubbles-and-add-proper-chatbubble-muting For more details.",
